  "content": "\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - Flowery Mooblooms\" title=\"Friends&amp;Foes - Flowery Mooblooms\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Купить мне кофе\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Стать патроном\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Присоединиться к нашему Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Вики\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Friends&Foes - Flowery Mooblooms — это небольшое дополнение к моду Friends&Foes, добавляющее по одному варианту муублума для каждого цветка. Муублумов можно найти в биомах лугов и цветочных лесов. Более подробную информацию о муублумах вы можете найти в <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">вики</a>.</span>\n</p>\n\t\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>🐮 Варианты муублумов</h1>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Аллиум</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Голубой колосок</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"Муублум Аллиум\" title=\"Муублум Аллиум\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" width=\"146\" alt=\"Муублум Голубой колосок\" title=\"Муублум Голубой колосок\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Голубая орхидея</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Василёк</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"Муублум Голубая орхидея\" title=\"Муублум Голубая орхидея\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" width=\"139\" alt=\"Муублум Василёк\" title=\"Муублум Василёк\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Одуванчик</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Сирень</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/