Пион\" title=\"Муублум Пион\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Розовый тюльпан</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Мак</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"Муублум Розовый тюльпан\" title=\"Муублум Розовый тюльпан\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"Муублум Мак\" title=\"Муублум Мак\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Красный тюльпан</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Розовый куст</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"Муублум Красный тюльпан\" title=\"Муублум Красный тюльпан\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"Муублум Розовый куст\" title=\"Муублум Розовый куст\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Подсолнух</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Белый тюльпан</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\